        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier; Herbie Rides Again; Davy Crockett and the River Pirates\n- Companies: Walt Disney; Walt Disney Productions\n- People: Fess Parker\n- Systems: Disney television series Davy Crockett\n\nFacts:\n- Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier is a 1955 live-action Walt Disney adventure film starring Fess Parker as Davy Crockett.\n- Davy Crockett and the River Pirates is a prequel to the 1955 film Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier.\n- Davy Crockett and the River Pirates is an edited compilation of the fourth and fifth stories from the Disney television series Davy Crockett.\n- Herbie Rides Again is a 1974 American comedy film.\n- Herbie Rides Again is a sequel to The Love Bug, which had been released six years earlier.\n- Herbie Rides Again is the second film in a Walt Disney Productions series about an anthropomorphic and autonomous 1963 Volkswagen racing Beetle named Herbie.",
